01:30.707 --> 01:36.087
The Day Naruto Was Born

01:42.457 --> 01:48.917
Minato... You intended for your brat to
clean up after your mess, right?

01:49.757 --> 01:54.087
That's why you sealed
my other half inside him...

01:54.797 --> 01:58.097
as if you were confident they would
be able to work together.

01:59.347 --> 02:00.517
Nine Tails...

02:01.227 --> 02:03.807
Then don't regret it now.

02:04.767 --> 02:07.767
It's not your fault
that Kushina died.

02:08.777 --> 02:12.647
And making your brat into
a Jinchuriki wasn't a bad thing either.

02:13.567 --> 02:17.117
Because your brat is trying
to change...

02:17.237 --> 02:20.327
what this world has
become right now.

02:20.537 --> 02:23.167
He's not that
newborn babe anymore.

02:23.707 --> 02:25.577
In fact, tomorrow is...

02:26.877 --> 02:27.957
Naruto...

02:29.707 --> 02:32.627
Listen up... I need to
tell you something...

02:45.767 --> 02:48.017
I knew it! I figured as much.

02:50.277 --> 02:53.897
I can't believe the Ten Tails'
Jinchuriki has such a weakness!

02:55.447 --> 02:58.657
<i>And with Ten Tails inside me,</i>
<i>I can't pass through things either!</i>

03:00.447 --> 03:01.747
<i>How frustrating!</i>

03:05.117 --> 03:06.747
Sage moves will work!

03:07.287 --> 03:08.537
Sage Power?

03:08.707 --> 03:11.587
The toad attacks are Sage Jutsu...

03:11.667 --> 03:13.377
They use Nature Energy.

03:13.917 --> 03:17.297
Come to think of it, when I tried
to sense Ten Tails' power,

03:17.387 --> 03:19.427
it was Nature Energy itself.

03:19.887 --> 03:24.347
So you can maybe counter
Nature Energy with Nature Energy.

03:24.597 --> 03:26.647
Not that I really understand it.

03:27.807 --> 03:30.977
I'm just glad I learned
Sage Jutsu! All right!

03:32.477 --> 03:34.187
Next up is Frog Kumite!

03:39.947 --> 03:43.407
<i>He instantly grasped how to use</i>
<i>the Flying Raijin with me...</i>

03:43.497 --> 03:46.117
<i>and has even mastered</i>
<i>Sage Power.</i>

03:47.417 --> 03:50.377
<i>I feel like I'm fighting</i>
<i>alongside Elder Brother!</i>

04:00.677 --> 04:02.717
It clearly worked.
But he's recovered already,

04:02.807 --> 04:05.267
and now he's guarding his back.

04:07.227 --> 04:09.897
<i>If we teleport behind him carelessly,</i>
<i>we might get erased.</i>

04:17.647 --> 04:19.987
I should start preparing for
the Tsukuyomi.

04:20.067 --> 04:21.697
Let's tidy things up.

04:40.547 --> 04:44.927
There is nothing worth saving
in this reality.

04:48.097 --> 04:50.397
This world is already dead.

05:00.027 --> 05:01.617
Hey... This is super bad!

05:01.697 --> 05:03.737
Four of them... all at once?

05:03.907 --> 05:06.827
Even if we were to create
an Earth Style Wall,

05:06.907 --> 05:08.117
it wouldn't be enough!

05:08.367 --> 05:09.657
There are too many of them!

05:10.827 --> 05:13.457
<i>What do we do? Think!</i>

05:14.417 --> 05:16.667
It would take one person
per each of those

05:16.757 --> 05:18.087
to teleport away using
the Flying Raijin.

05:19.007 --> 05:21.427
The Fourth and I can get
to two of them,

05:21.507 --> 05:23.507
but that leaves two others!
Impossible!

05:25.217 --> 05:26.057
Where's Elder Brother?

05:27.427 --> 05:29.477
Madara! Could you wait a moment?

05:29.637 --> 05:31.807
Your comrade is acting up...!

05:32.517 --> 05:34.107
We are all Reanimations!

05:34.227 --> 05:35.567
There's no need to worry!

05:35.647 --> 05:37.277
Keep fighting!

05:38.777 --> 05:40.737
Do not give up everyone!

05:40.777 --> 05:43.617
I am with you!
My clones are with you!

05:43.777 --> 05:46.027
We only need to change
the spheres' trajectories!

05:46.117 --> 05:47.577
The other Hokage will
also take measures

05:47.657 --> 05:49.697
and repel them across the ocean!

05:50.207 --> 05:52.327
I ask that you all work on putting up
an Earth Style Wall!

05:52.417 --> 05:53.957
I'll use the Deep Forest
Emergence to launch

05:54.037 --> 05:56.167
and guide them to
toward the ocean!

05:56.497 --> 05:57.707
I won't let you!

06:06.677 --> 06:08.307
<i>Six Crimson Ray Formation!</i>

06:16.357 --> 06:17.357
A barrier!

06:17.607 --> 06:19.897
Hey! Don't tell me we're...

06:23.487 --> 06:25.567
He's trapped everyone
inside the barrier,

06:25.657 --> 06:28.577
and he's made it so we can't
expel the Tailed Beast Bombs!

06:31.997 --> 06:33.617
Endgame.

06:34.247 --> 06:36.577
Our only choice now is
to teleport those spheres

06:36.667 --> 06:38.497
outside the barrier using
the Flying Raijin.

06:39.207 --> 06:41.127
Fourth, can you handle two of them?

06:42.007 --> 06:45.297
Since we can't mark them,
I can only take one.

06:46.177 --> 06:47.677
There's only one way.

06:50.177 --> 06:50.887
We could...

06:51.307 --> 06:54.727
You intend to teleport
the stalk itself outside?

06:55.017 --> 06:56.597
You think I'd let you do that?

06:57.227 --> 06:59.227
You can't save anyone!

07:02.487 --> 07:03.277
Dad!

07:04.397 --> 07:07.697
I don't know if it will work,
but I've got an idea.

07:10.117 --> 07:12.287
Will you bump fists with me?

07:31.427 --> 07:35.057
Hey, other half. How ya been?

07:35.387 --> 07:38.477
Do you mind sharing some
of your chakra with me?

07:41.357 --> 07:46.277
To be asked a favor from myself
feels a bit weird...

07:47.197 --> 07:48.157
Naruto...

07:48.567 --> 07:50.777
Minato's useless,
he can't do anything.

07:50.947 --> 07:53.577
He couldn't even
protect your mom...

07:57.417 --> 07:58.827
Nor his own subordinates.

08:03.167 --> 08:05.757
You know what tomorrow is,
don't you?

08:10.217 --> 08:12.467
It's the anniversary of
Minato and Kushina's deaths.

08:13.427 --> 08:15.227
The day both of your parent's died.

08:30.317 --> 08:33.697
In this world, it's over
when you die.

08:33.867 --> 08:34.577
You see...

08:34.577 --> 08:37.577
Oh, right, which means...

08:37.907 --> 08:39.617
it's also the day I was born!

08:50.587 --> 08:51.797
So you see...

08:52.597 --> 08:53.717
It's not over...

08:57.477 --> 08:59.637
'Cuz I exist in this world!

09:01.347 --> 09:05.527
<i>Our Naruto has</i>
<i>become really strong...</i>

09:06.567 --> 09:07.737
<i>... Kushina.</i>

09:12.487 --> 09:13.867
Let's go, Dad!

09:14.407 --> 09:15.157
Yeah!

09:34.797 --> 09:37.297
Thank goodness for
the chakra of you two!

09:37.587 --> 09:39.427
It's just as I thought!

09:39.967 --> 09:44.217
Yeah well, the both of us
used to be one, after all.

09:45.017 --> 09:49.357
Plus... those two are
father and son.

09:55.027 --> 09:56.777
He's planning to trap us
inside this barrier

09:56.857 --> 09:59.067
and blow us up along with it!

09:59.487 --> 10:00.947
What can we do?

10:01.577 --> 10:05.867
<i>The Hokage's barrier didn't let</i>
<i>Tailed Beast Bombs through either...</i>

10:18.217 --> 10:20.547
<i>This barrier is red all over...</i>

10:20.587 --> 10:22.927
<i>I think it's accurate to say that</i>

10:23.007 --> 10:26.017
<i>this one's likely to be</i>
<i>on par with the Hokages.</i>

10:27.017 --> 10:28.687
<i>With the level of our strength,</i>

10:28.767 --> 10:32.227
<i>it's impossible for us to</i>
<i>smash through it, in which case...</i>

10:36.357 --> 10:40.607
<i>Damn it!</i>
<i>Nothing's coming to mind, Dad!</i>

10:41.907 --> 10:43.947
What's your plan, Naruto?

10:45.037 --> 10:48.247
Just... give me some time to focus...

10:54.747 --> 10:57.007
Let me explain what
Kurama and I came up with.

10:57.087 --> 11:00.087
You tell me if
it will work or not, okay?

11:02.087 --> 11:04.807
All right, go ahead!

11:09.347 --> 11:11.017
<i>Have you seen him, Kushina?</i>

11:12.437 --> 11:16.527
<i>Our Naruto's really grown up.</i>

11:22.197 --> 11:24.987
<i>I'm so sorry, Naruto...</i>

11:26.737 --> 11:30.997
<i>I'm sure you must have had it</i>
<i>real tough up until now!</i>

11:32.167 --> 11:34.787
<i>The real tough part</i>
<i>is about to start, Dad!</i>

11:45.097 --> 11:46.307
This is Naruto's...!

11:49.017 --> 11:51.227
So... it wasn't depleted?!

11:51.597 --> 11:54.647
I noticed it when
I was healing everyone, but...

11:55.147 --> 11:57.647
It seems it had merely shrunk down.

11:58.107 --> 12:01.487
It's bigger and more powerful
than before!

12:02.147 --> 12:04.447
Have ya noticed Eight-o?

12:04.947 --> 12:08.077
I sense two Nine Tails,
one light and one dark, yo!

12:08.197 --> 12:10.747
This isn't just Nine Tails.

12:11.787 --> 12:14.497
You're thinking about
protecting us from that attack

12:14.577 --> 12:16.747
with this chakra, Naruto?

12:25.217 --> 12:26.087
Jugo.

12:27.007 --> 12:31.177
Sasuke, this is looking bad.
Let's get outside of this barrier.

12:31.767 --> 12:33.517
Use the Snake
Reverse Summoning.

12:34.057 --> 12:35.227
That was my plan already.

12:35.597 --> 12:38.107
I'll take you and Naruto
with me.

12:39.227 --> 12:42.147
I haven't given you
any of my chakra yet.

12:42.947 --> 12:44.447
Get over here, will ya?

12:46.197 --> 12:48.487
What's your chakra
going to accomplish?

12:48.577 --> 12:50.947
There's no time! Just hurry!

12:54.787 --> 12:58.417
I can't believe he shared
his chakra with every shinobi!

12:58.917 --> 13:00.997
He's got almost as
much chakra as us!

13:02.377 --> 13:03.417
No!

13:03.797 --> 13:06.047
Actually, this has
Nine Tails' chakra mixed in!

13:07.087 --> 13:09.467
<i>That won't help you</i>
<i>withstand the shock wave of</i>

13:09.557 --> 13:13.057
<i>four Ten Tails' Tailed Beast</i>
<i>Bombs exploding together!</i>

13:14.097 --> 13:15.437
<i>Begone...</i>

14:17.617 --> 14:18.537
What?

14:21.167 --> 14:22.337
What happened?

14:24.247 --> 14:26.967
This chakra protected us again!

14:27.467 --> 14:29.637
Not quite, check it out!

14:31.087 --> 14:33.217
Choji... Look over there.

14:34.307 --> 14:35.347
We're...

14:37.177 --> 14:38.767
outside the barrier.

14:42.267 --> 14:43.897
It was the Teleportation Jutsu.

14:43.977 --> 14:47.317
Damn that Naruto!
He's even mastered that too?

14:49.027 --> 14:50.947
This isn't just Naruto's chakra.

14:51.067 --> 14:55.577
He moved everyone using
the Fourth Hokage's Flying Raijin Jutsu!

14:56.867 --> 14:57.957
Fourth...

14:58.457 --> 15:02.877
This is the second time
you've saved all of shinobi-kind.

15:06.667 --> 15:11.257
I've still failed...

15:13.847 --> 15:15.757
more times than that,

15:17.267 --> 15:19.427
so I must continue making up for it.

15:22.187 --> 15:23.057
What did you do?

15:24.187 --> 15:29.107
Dad teleported everyone
outside the barrier.

15:29.527 --> 15:31.107
Everyone? With that jutsu?

15:32.447 --> 15:34.657
I can't teleport
anything that I myself,

15:34.737 --> 15:37.117
or my chakra isn't touching,
even indirectly.

15:38.327 --> 15:39.077
How?

15:43.327 --> 15:48.707
I'd shared Kurama's and
my chakra with everyone earlier.

15:49.457 --> 15:54.087
So if Dad, and our chakra
and everybody were to uh... um...

15:54.177 --> 15:55.217
Indirectly...

15:55.297 --> 15:58.217
Right! If we were all
in indirect contact with each other,

15:58.267 --> 15:59.557
it would work.

15:59.677 --> 16:03.397
So, I connected Dad's chakra
with Kurama's and mine.

16:03.847 --> 16:04.937
That's all!

16:05.807 --> 16:08.437
He used the principle
of Shadow Clones.

16:09.107 --> 16:11.647
Even if you split up and
disperse your chakra...

16:11.737 --> 16:14.107
as long as you keep even
a little bit there without putting it out...

16:14.197 --> 16:17.947
when the original body infuses
chakra again to regain control,

16:18.037 --> 16:21.367
all the individual chakra bits
begin resonating and link together.

16:21.617 --> 16:26.247
In short, by joining his chakra
with the Fourth's,

16:26.327 --> 16:29.167
Naruto linked the Fourth
to the rest of his chakra

16:29.247 --> 16:31.167
residing in everyone else.

16:32.047 --> 16:33.547
Right, Naruto?

16:34.007 --> 16:35.757
Huh? Is that what I did?

16:36.087 --> 16:36.967
Never mind...

16:37.217 --> 16:41.217
Old Man Second, you sure know
a lot about my Shadow Clones too!

16:41.267 --> 16:42.977
I created that jutsu!

16:43.057 --> 16:44.807
It's my Shadow Clone Jutsu!

16:48.897 --> 16:51.107
<i>Will you bump fists with me?</i>

16:52.027 --> 16:53.237
<i>Yeah!</i>

17:10.917 --> 17:12.667
<i>Yeah, let's try it!</i>

17:13.257 --> 17:15.877
<i>There's nothing we can't do</i>
<i>if we borrow Nine Tails'...</i>

17:15.967 --> 17:17.337
<i>I mean, Kurama's power.</i>

17:17.427 --> 17:18.257
<i>All right!</i>

17:18.427 --> 17:20.717
<i>Then let's all four of us join forces!</i>

17:21.007 --> 17:25.097
<i>"All four of us," eh?</i>
<i>You treat us like we're human too.</i>

17:25.187 --> 17:27.437
<i>What kind of childrearing</i>
<i>has led to this, eh?</i>

17:31.437 --> 17:32.357
Naruto...

17:32.687 --> 17:33.687
Huh?!

17:34.237 --> 17:35.947
I wish there was more time...

17:36.067 --> 17:38.567
to talk to the grown-up you...

17:38.657 --> 17:41.197
Guys don't need to talk!

17:41.657 --> 17:43.117
I already know!

17:47.867 --> 17:51.667
I... already met Mom's chakra.

17:56.087 --> 17:59.587
<i>Kushina... my time is running out...</i>

18:00.757 --> 18:03.517
<i>I'm going start</i>
<i>the Eight Signed Seal.</i>

18:04.097 --> 18:07.807
<i>I want to put some of</i>
<i>my chakra in Naruto too.</i>

18:08.847 --> 18:10.437
<i>It'll be quite a while before</i>
<i>we can see him.</i>

18:10.517 --> 18:13.147
<i>Let's tell him</i>
<i>what we want to say...</i>

18:14.067 --> 18:15.317
<i>Naruto...</i>

18:16.027 --> 18:20.277
<i>Don't be picky.</i>
<i>Eat lots and grow strong.</i>

18:21.317 --> 18:25.327
<i>Make sure you bathe</i>
<i>every day and stay warm.</i>

18:25.947 --> 18:29.957
<i>Also... don't stay up late.</i>
<i>You need lots of sleep.</i>

18:30.327 --> 18:33.377
<i>And... make friends.</i>

18:34.047 --> 18:38.507
<i>You don't need a lot of friends.</i>
<i>Just a few...</i>

18:38.587 --> 18:40.797
<i>Ones you can really,</i>
<i>really trust.</i>

18:42.797 --> 18:46.307
<i>I wasn't very good at it,</i>
<i>but keep up with your studies</i>

18:46.427 --> 18:48.347
<i>and practice your ninjutsu hard.</i>

18:49.137 --> 18:53.727
<i>Remember that everyone has</i>
<i>strengths and weaknesses.</i>

18:54.187 --> 18:58.067
<i>So don't get too depressed</i>
<i>if you can't do something well.</i>

18:59.197 --> 19:04.027
<i>Respect your teachers and</i>
<i>upperclassmen at the Academy.</i>

19:04.737 --> 19:07.157
<i>Oh, and this is important...</i>

19:07.787 --> 19:10.247
<i>It's about the Three Prohibitions</i>
<i>for a shinobi.</i>

19:10.367 --> 19:13.497
<i>Be extra careful about</i>
<i>lending and borrowing money.</i>

19:14.537 --> 19:17.207
<i>Put your mission wages</i>
<i>into your savings account.</i>

19:18.167 --> 19:20.217
<i>No alcohol until you're of age.</i>

19:21.007 --> 19:24.967
<i>Too much can ruin your health,</i>
<i>so drink in moderation.</i>

19:25.467 --> 19:29.177
<i>Another Prohibition is women.</i>

19:29.677 --> 19:31.597
<i>I'm a woman,</i>

19:31.687 --> 19:33.897
<i>so I don't know too much</i>
<i>about this but...</i>

19:34.187 --> 19:36.687
<i>All you need to remember</i>
<i>is that this world</i>

19:36.777 --> 19:38.737
<i>is made up of men and women.</i>

19:39.527 --> 19:42.697
<i>So it's only natural to take</i>
<i>an interest in girls...</i>

19:42.777 --> 19:45.487
<i>But just don't get hooked</i>
<i>on bad women.</i>

19:46.907 --> 19:49.247
<i>Find someone just like me.</i>

19:49.827 --> 19:53.207
<i>Speaking of</i>
<i>the Three Prohibitions,</i>

19:53.957 --> 19:56.797
<i>Be wary of Jiraiya Sensei.</i>

20:01.467 --> 20:07.257
<i>Naruto... from now on, you're going</i>
<i>to face lots of pain and hardship...</i>

20:07.717 --> 20:10.227
<i>Be true to yourself...</i>

20:10.727 --> 20:12.437
<i>Have a dream... and...</i>

20:13.057 --> 20:18.017
<i>have the confidence to make</i>
<i>that dream come true!</i>

20:18.397 --> 20:22.067
<i>There's so much...</i>
<i>oh, so much more...</i>

20:22.147 --> 20:28.157
<i>There's so much more that</i>
<i>I want to pass on to you...</i>

20:28.947 --> 20:30.827
<i>I wish I could stay</i>
<i>with you longer...</i>

20:32.117 --> 20:33.207
<i>I love you.</i>

20:34.917 --> 20:37.537
<i>Minato, I'm sorry I used up</i>
<i>your time...</i>

20:38.587 --> 20:39.667
<i>It's okay.</i>

20:41.167 --> 20:44.677
<i>Naruto, my words to you</i>
<i>as your father are...</i>

20:44.757 --> 20:49.347
<i>I guess it's the same</i>
<i>as your nagging mother's.</i>

20:51.307 --> 20:55.187
What you want to say is the same
as my nagging mom, right?!

20:55.477 --> 20:57.267
I already know!

